        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p><a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/cheapassgames/cheapass-games-in-black-and-white/posts/2467865\">The Cheapass Games Kickstarter's first update post mentions it.</a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Well, a \"partnership\" at least, if not a merger in particular.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\n> </p>\r\n> \r\n> <p><strong>Greater Than Games Partnership</strong></p>\r\n> \r\n> <p>We're thrilled to announce our new partnership with Greater Than Games of St. Louis, MO. You might know Greater Than Games from hits like <em>Sentinels of the Multiverse</em> and <em>Spirit Island</em>. Partnering with Greater Than Games will free James from the business and logistical obligations of game publishing, and allow him to focus on completing <em>Cheapass Games in Black and White</em>, design more games, and maybe one day even spend some time on a beach.</p>\r\n> \r\n> <p>This also means that Greater Than Games will be handling the printing and fulfillment of the Kickstarter, so don't be surprised to see some of their crew pop in to answer questions!</p>\r\n> \r\n> <p>\n</p>",
